* ADP7118 adjustable LDO: 3.3 V input, 1.8 V output, 50 mA load
* Uses the genuine Analog Devices ADP7118 SPICE macro-model.
.include ADP7118.cir

VINPUT IN 0 3.3
CIN IN 0 2.2u Rser=20m

* ADP7118 model pin order: VIN GND EN SENSE/ADJ VOUT
XU1 IN 0 IN FB OUT ADP7118

* VOUT = 1.2 V * (1 + RFB_TOP/RFB_BOTTOM) = 1.8 V
RFB_TOP OUT FB 10k
RFB_BOTTOM FB 0 20k

COUT OUT 0 2.2u Rser=20m
RLOAD OUT 0 36

.tran 0 10m 0 1u startup
.meas tran vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 9m TO 10m

.end
